      "name": "Question 8",
      "problem": "$-52-502=${{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "The answer will be negative since $-52$ is negative, and we're subtracting $502$ from it.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n52+502\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the addition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,+\\,\\,\\,\\, &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have \n\n$$\n52+502=554.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n-52-502=-554.\n$$",
