    "q-174112": {
      "dom_id": "step-q174112",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "$-30-215=${{field-1}}",
      "worked_solution": "The answer will be negative since $-30$ is negative, and we're subtracting $215$ from it.\n\nWe start by solving an easier problem:\n\n$$\n30+215\n$$\n\nNext, we carry out the addition:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} &  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,3\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,0\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\ \\,\\,\\,\\,+\\,\\,\\,\\, &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,1\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\, \\\\  &  & \\,\\,\\,\\,2\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,4\\,\\,\\,\\, & \\,\\,\\,\\,5\\,\\,\\,\\,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we have \n\n$$\n30+215=245.\n$$\n\nHowever, since our answer must be negative, we need to change the sign of the answer above. \n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n-30-215=-245.\n$$",
